     always opens the TV guide, however the channel was started, as TiviMate's
     and Sky's; it says so (silo.guide.fromplayer), and Back again there soon
     after leaves the guide (build_tv.py, window 1189). Just after Live TV's
     mini guide closes (timer silo_mini_closed, 4 s), Back does nothing: one
     meant for the mini guide as it closed by itself. -->
